 }
 source {
 htmlCode: ```html
<div id="genesis-control"><p class="eyebrow">ORACLE-OWNED STATE / AUTHENTICATED CONTROL</p><h1>Genesis Control Center</h1><p class="lede">The database owns every generation. Pending candidates await the browser evaluation worker.</p><label for="control-run">Experiment</label><select id="control-run"></select><section id="control-metrics" class="instrument-bar"></section><div class="transport"><button type="button" data-control="PAUSE">Pause</button><button type="button" data-control="RESUME">Resume</button><button type="button" data-control="STOP">Stop</button><button type="button" data-control="STEP">Run one generation</button><button type="button" data-control="STOP_AI">Stop AI</button></div><p id="control-heartbeat" role="status"></p><h2>Evolution events</h2><ol id="control-events"></ol></div>
```
 }
